<title>USA: GPU unit says agrees to Nestle settlement.</title>
<headline>GPU unit says agrees to Nestle settlement.</headline>
<dateline>MORRISTOWN, N.J. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>GPU Energy, a unit of GPU Inc, said Thursday it reached a settlement in a lawsuit brought by a U.S. unit of Nestle SA against it and Freehold Cogeneration Associates LP.</p>
<p>GPU said the three companies have agreed to dismiss pending litigation and other proceedings between them. Other terms are confidential.</p>
</text>
